Description: add the V\OS network kit headers to the include path
 The packaged /etc/vos.specs carries no -I entry for
 /system/develop/headers/os/net, so bare includes of the network kit
 headers (NetworkInterface.h, NetworkRoster.h) do not resolve with the
 engine's default flags.  Point the engine at that directory.
Author: Dario Casalinuovo <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@
 #	additional paths to look for system headers
 #	thes use the form: #include <header>
 #	source file directories are NOT auto-included here
-SYSTEM_INCLUDE_PATHS =
+SYSTEM_INCLUDE_PATHS = /system/develop/headers/os/net
 
 #	additional paths to look for local headers
 #	thes use the form: #include "header"
